to the indicated ground rods.  When work in addition to that indicated or specified is directed to obtain the 
specified ground resistance, the provision of the contract covering "Changes" applies.</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/></SPT>
<SPT><TTL>Connections</TTL><BRK/>
