<BRK/></SPT>
<SPT><TTL>Grounding and Bonding Equipment</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT><RID>UL 467</RID>, except as indicated or specified otherwise.</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/></SPT>
</SPT>]<SPT><TTL>INSTALLATION OF EQUIPMENT AND ASSEMBLIES</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Install and connect equipment furnished under this section as indicated on project drawings, the approved shop 
